---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="NetSuite Services | Inscio"
  description="From evaluation to optimization — NetSuite expertise at every stage. Inscio has been helping businesses get real value from NetSuite since 2005."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-[#0D1235] text-white py-28 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-blue-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">NETSUITE SERVICES</p>
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight mb-8 max-w-3xl">
        From evaluation to optimization —<br class="hidden md:block"/> <span class="text-blue-400">NetSuite expertise</span><br class="hidden md:block"/> at every stage.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-10">
        Inscio has been helping businesses get real value from NetSuite since 2005 — evaluation, implementation, training, managed services, optimization, and AI.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a href="https://calendly.com/brian-gallagher-inscio/netsuite-strategy-session" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded transition-colors">
          Schedule a Strategy Call
        </a>
        <a href="#navigator"
          class="border border-white text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-[#0D1235] font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded transition-colors">
          See Navigator Plans
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services overview -->
  <section class="bg-white py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-14">
        <p class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">WHAT WE DO</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Every stage of your NetSuite journey, covered.</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg">Whether you're evaluating, implementing, optimizing, or scaling — we have the expertise and services to meet you where you are.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        {[
          { href: '#evaluation', title: 'Evaluation & Licensing', desc: 'Unbiased assessment, tailored demos, and contract negotiation on your behalf.' },
          { href: '#implementation', title: 'Implementation', desc: 'Structured deployments with milestone-driven methodology and dedicated consultants.' },
          { href: '#training', title: 'Training', desc: 'Role-based training built on your own data and workflows — not generic product demos.' },
          { href: '#development', title: 'Development & Customization', desc: 'SuiteScript, SuiteFlow, workflow automation, custom records — all upgrade-safe and documented.' },
          { href: '#integration', title: 'Integration', desc: 'Connect NetSuite to eCommerce, CRM, EDI, payroll, 3PL, and more — reliably.' },
          { href: '#analytics', title: 'Analytics & Reporting', desc: 'KPI dashboards, saved searches, and BI connectivity that actually drive decisions.' },
          { href: '#ai', title: 'AI & Intelligent Automation', desc: 'AI-powered forecasting, intelligent workflow automation, and NetSuite\'s evolving AI capabilities.' },
          { href: '#support', title: 'Support & Remediation', desc: 'Break-fix support, health checks, and rescue engagements for struggling implementations.' },
          { href: '#navigator', title: 'Navigator Services', desc: 'Monthly plans that keep your NetSuite continuously improving with predictable costs.' },
        ].map(svc => (
          <a href={svc.href} class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-blue-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">{svc.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">{svc.desc}</p>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Evaluation -->
  <section id="evaluation" class="bg-gray-50 py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">GETTING STARTED</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Evaluation & Licensing</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Not sure if NetSuite is right for your business? We'll help you find out — honestly, without pressure or guesswork. And when you're ready to buy, we negotiate the best possible deal on your behalf.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Our evaluation process gives you a clear picture of whether NetSuite solves your specific business problems before you ever sign anything. We guide you through discovery, live demonstrations tailored to your actual workflows, and a complete solution design. When it's time to license, we negotiate directly with NetSuite to secure favorable pricing, the right module scope, and contract terms that protect you.
        </p>
        <a href="https://calendly.com/brian-gallagher-inscio/netsuite-strategy-session" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-block bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded transition-colors">
          Start Your Evaluation
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-8">
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          {[
            'Discovery: understand your real requirements, not just a checkbox list',
            'Tailored NetSuite demo built around your actual workflows',
            'Solution refinement and full scoping before any commitment',
            'TCO and ROI analysis available',
            'Contract negotiation with NetSuite on your behalf',
            'Module guidance — pay only for what you actually need',
            'Flexible subscription options starting at $99/month',
            'Industry-specific solution mapping included',
          ].map(b => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-700 text-sm">
              <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold mt-0.5">→</span>
              <span>{b}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-gray-500 italic">Inscio is a certified NetSuite Solution Provider. We've negotiated hundreds of contracts and know how to protect your investment from day one.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Implementation -->
  <section id="implementation" class="bg-white py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
      <div class="order-2 md:order-1 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-8">
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          {[
            'Proven methodology: Engage → Drive → Enable → Convert',
            'Work Breakdown Structure with defined milestones and ownership',
            'Process alignment before configuration begins',
            'Data migration planning and execution',
            'User acceptance testing and go-live support',
            'Post go-live hypercare period',
            'Fixed-fee options available for defined scope projects',
            'Industry-specific leading practices built in',
          ].map(b => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-700 text-sm">
              <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold mt-0.5">→</span>
              <span>{b}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
        <p class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">GO-LIVE</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Implementation</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Every implementation is unique. We treat it that way. Our methodology maximizes the chances of a successful go-live — on time, on budget, with your team ready to run the system from day one.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          We use a structured Work Breakdown Structure approach built around four phases: Engage, Drive, Enable, and Convert. Each phase has defined milestones, clear ownership, and built-in checkpoints to catch problems before they become expensive. We don't just configure software — we align your processes, data, and people with how NetSuite is designed to work.
        </p>
        <a href="https://calendly.com/brian-gallagher-inscio/netsuite-strategy-session" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-block bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded transition-colors">
          Discuss Your Project
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Training -->
  <section id="training" class="bg-gray-50 py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">USER ADOPTION</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Training</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          The best NetSuite configuration in the world delivers nothing if your team doesn't know how to use it. Our training programs are built around real business workflows — not generic product demos.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          We offer onsite and remote training across all NetSuite functional areas: accounting, sales, operations, purchasing, inventory, and more. Training uses your own data and your own processes, so it transfers immediately to day-to-day work. Available as part of an implementation or as a standalone service for teams that need a refresh, role-specific enablement, or help onboarding new staff.
        </p>
        <a href="https://calendly.com/brian-gallagher-inscio/netsuite-strategy-session" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-block bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded transition-colors">
          Talk About Training
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-8">
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          {[
            'Role-based training: finance, sales, ops, purchasing, admin, and more',
            'Onsite or remote delivery options',
            'In-person sessions at our Plano, TX training facility',
            'Training built on your own live data and workflows',
            'Custom guides and reference materials included',
            'New employee onboarding programs',
            'Available standalone or bundled with implementation',
          ].map(b => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-700 text-sm">
              <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold mt-0.5">→</span>
              <span>{b}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Development -->
  <section id="development" class="bg-white py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
      <div class="order-2 md:order-1 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-8">
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          {[
            'SuiteScript development: user events, scheduled scripts, RESTlets',
            'SuiteFlow workflow automation and approval routing',
            'Custom fields, records, forms, and sublists',
            'Custom dashboards, saved searches, and reports',
            'User role and permission architecture',
            'NetSuite SuiteApp development and bundle creation',
            'Upgrade-safe customization methodology',
            'Full technical documentation on every project',
          ].map(b => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-700 text-sm">
              <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold mt-0.5">→</span>
              <span>{b}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
        <p class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">PLATFORM DEVELOPMENT</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Development & Customization</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          NetSuite is powerful out of the box, but no two businesses operate the same way. Our development team builds the customizations, scripts, and workflows that make NetSuite work exactly the way your business does.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          We work exclusively within NetSuite's SuiteCloud Platform — the right way to extend the system so your customizations survive upgrades and don't create technical debt. From custom fields and records to complex SuiteScript automations, we build solutions that are clean, documented, and maintainable.
        </p>
        <a href="https://calendly.com/brian-gallagher-inscio/netsuite-strategy-session" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-block bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded transition-colors">
          Discuss Your Requirements
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Integration -->
  <section id="integration" class="bg-gray-50 py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">CONNECTIVITY</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Integration</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          NetSuite doesn't exist in a vacuum. We build secure, reliable integrations that connect NetSuite to the other systems your business depends on — eCommerce, CRM, EDI, payroll, logistics, and more.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          We use NetSuite's SuiteCloud integration platform and REST APIs to build connections that are scalable, maintainable, and built for real data volumes.
        </p>
        <a href="https://calendly.com/brian-gallagher-inscio/netsuite-strategy-session" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-block bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded transition-colors">
          Discuss Your Integration
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-8">
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          {[
            'RESTful and SOAP web service integrations',
            'EDI integration (warehouses, suppliers, retail partners)',
            'eCommerce platform connections (Shopify, Magento, BigCommerce)',
            'CRM integration (Salesforce, HubSpot)',
            'Payroll and HR system connections',
            '3PL and logistics platform connectivity',
            'Real-time and scheduled sync options',
            'SuiteCloud standard compliance on all integrations',
          ].map(b => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-700 text-sm">
              <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold mt-0.5">→</span>
              <span>{b}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Analytics -->
  <section id="analytics" class="bg-white py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
      <div class="order-2 md:order-1 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-8">
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          {[
            'Executive KPI dashboards built to your business metrics',
            'Financial reporting: P&L, balance sheet, cash flow by entity',
            'Saved searches and custom report builder configuration',
            'NetSuite Analytics Workbook implementation',
            'Inventory, operations, and fulfillment reporting',
            'Sales performance and CRM pipeline reporting',
            'Third-party BI connectivity (Tableau, Power BI)',
            'Automated report scheduling and distribution',
          ].map(b => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-700 text-sm">
              <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold mt-0.5">→</span>
              <span>{b}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
        <p class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">BUSINESS INTELLIGENCE</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Analytics & Reporting</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          NetSuite captures enormous amounts of business data. We help you turn it into dashboards, reports, and insights that actually drive decisions — not just look good in a quarterly review.
        </p>
        <a href="https://calendly.com/brian-gallagher-inscio/netsuite-strategy-session" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-block bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded transition-colors">
          Talk About Your Reporting
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- AI -->
  <section id="ai" class="bg-gray-50 py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">AI & AUTOMATION</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">AI & Intelligent Automation</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          NetSuite is increasingly AI-capable — and the way you automate is changing fast. We help you apply NetSuite's AI-powered capabilities to the places in your business where they deliver the most impact.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Using NetSuite's SuiteCloud automation tools — SuiteFlow, SuiteScript, and AI-powered features — we build solutions that are practical, documented, and built to scale with your business.
        </p>
        <a href="https://calendly.com/brian-gallagher-inscio/netsuite-strategy-session" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-block bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded transition-colors">
          Explore AI Automation
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4">
        {[
          { icon: '🤖', title: 'Agentic AI Workflows', desc: 'AI agents that reason, decide, and act across your NetSuite environment — handling tasks that previously required human judgment.' },
          { icon: '🔗', title: 'Cross-System Intelligence', desc: 'Connect NetSuite data with your CRM, eCommerce, logistics, and external market data to surface insights no single system could see alone.' },
          { icon: '📊', title: 'AI-Powered Analytics', desc: 'AI-assisted forecasting, anomaly detection, and predictive analytics built directly on your live NetSuite data.' },
          { icon: '⚡', title: 'Process Intelligence & Automation', desc: 'Identify, map, and automate high-value processes using AI-enhanced SuiteCloud capabilities.' },
        ].map(item => (
          <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-5 flex gap-4">
            <span class="text-2xl">{item.icon}</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">{item.title}</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">{item.desc}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Support -->
  <section id="support" class="bg-white py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
      <div class="order-2 md:order-1 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-8">
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          {[
            'Break-fix support with defined response SLAs',
            'Post-implementation hypercare and stabilization',
            'NetSuite remediation and rescue engagements',
            'Current-state assessment and gap analysis',
            'Recovery planning for troubled implementations',
            'Customization audits and technical cleanup',
            'Data correction and reconciliation projects',
            'NetSuite version upgrade support and testing',
          ].map(b => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-700 text-sm">
              <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold mt-0.5">→</span>
              <span>{b}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
        <p class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">ONGOING SUPPORT</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Support & Remediation</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Whether you need a trusted partner to call when something breaks — or you've inherited a NetSuite environment that's a mess — we're here. Our team has seen everything, and we know how to get systems back on track fast.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Our support services range from break-fix tickets and day-to-day questions to full remediation engagements where we assess a struggling implementation, build a recovery plan, and fix the problems systematically.
        </p>
        <a href="https://calendly.com/brian-gallagher-inscio/netsuite-strategy-session" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-block bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded transition-colors">
          Talk to a Support Expert
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Navigator -->
  <section id="navigator" class="bg-[#0D1235] text-white py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-14">
        <p class="text-blue-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">THE INSCIO DIFFERENCE</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Navigator: The smarter way to run NetSuite, every single month.</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg">Traditional NetSuite support is reactive — you call when something breaks. Navigator is fundamentally different. It's a monthly partnership that keeps your NetSuite environment continuously improving, with predictable costs and no surprise invoices.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        {[
          {
            icon: '🗺️',
            name: 'Day Trip',
            tagline: 'For companies that need reliable NetSuite support and occasional expert guidance without heavy commitment.',
            features: [
              'Core consulting hours/month',
              'Priority response: 2 business days',
              '1 custom dashboard/search per quarter',
              'Email and ticket support',
              'Release Readiness reviews',
            ],
            popular: false,
          },
          {
            icon: '🚗',
            name: 'Road Trip',
            tagline: 'For growing companies that want consistent NetSuite improvement with responsive support and regular strategic check-ins.',
            features: [
              'Expanded consulting hours/month',
              'Priority response: 1 business day',
              'Up to 3 dashboards/searches per quarter',
              'Quarterly reviews + rollover (10 hrs)',
              'Explorer Sessions & Release Readiness',
              '2 hours training credits/year',
            ],
            popular: true,
          },
          {
            icon: '🏔️',
            name: 'Expedition',
            tagline: 'For companies treating NetSuite as a strategic platform. The highest level of ongoing partnership — proactive, strategic, and embedded in your operations.',
            features: [
              'Comprehensive consulting hours/month',
              'Priority response: same business day',
              'Unlimited dashboards & searches',
              'Reviews + Executive Summary + rollover (20 hrs)',
              'Monthly check-in call + Slack channel access',
              '2 hours training credits/quarter',
            ],
            popular: false,
          },
        ].map(plan => (
          <div class={`rounded-xl p-8 relative ${plan.popular ? 'bg-blue-600' : 'bg-white/10 border border-white/20'}`}>
            {plan.popular && (
              <div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-yellow-400 text-gray-900 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wide">Most Popular</div>
            )}
            <div class="text-3xl mb-4">{plan.icon}</div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">{plan.name}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/70 mb-6">{plan.tagline}</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              {plan.features.map(f => (
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-white/90">
                  <span class="text-green-400 mt-0.5">✓</span>
                  <span>{f}</span>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-gray-400 text-sm mt-8">All Navigator plans are monthly subscriptions with fixed, predictable fees. No project scoping delays. No surprise invoices. Just continuous NetSuite improvement.</p>
      <div class="text-center mt-8">
        <a href="https://calendly.com/brian-gallagher-inscio/netsuite-strategy-session" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-block bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded transition-colors">
          Get Started with Navigator
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-white py-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Not sure where to start?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg mb-8">A 30-minute strategy call with our team will help you figure out exactly which service fits where you are — no pressure, no sales pitch, just honest conversation.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">
        <span>✓ Free 30-minute strategy call</span>
        <span>✓ No commitment required</span>
        <span>✓ Response within one business day</span>
      </div>
      <a href="https://calendly.com/brian-gallagher-inscio/netsuite-strategy-session" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-block bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold px-10 py-4 rounded transition-colors">
        Schedule a Free Strategy Call
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
